    "Description": "GNOME Remote Desktop is a remote desktop and screen sharing service for the GNOME desktop environment.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* gnome-remote-desktop: gnome-remote-desktop: unauthenticated RDP sockets lack a handshake deadline (CVE-2026-96541)\n\n* gnome-remote-desktop: Busy-Wait DoS in VNC TLS I/O Handlers (GNUTLS_E_AGAIN / GNUTLS_E_INTERRUPTED) (CVE-2026-109832)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
